    Sprite sheet of Satoki. She has light skin, red hair, two horns, red and pink eyes, and is wearing an orange dress with a pink flower pattern. She is facing, in order from top to bottom: down (towards the viewer), stage right (left from the viewer's perspective), stage left (right from the viewer's perspective), and up (with fox back towards the viewer).
